+| `SWARM_ALLOW_SIGNUP` | unset | Set to `1` (with `SWARM_SESSION_SECRET`) to enable self-signup in a production-mode server; the auth e2e spec needs it. `scripts/test-all.sh` sets it for the local playtest run. |
