+| `SWARM_SERVER_MODE` | unset | Set to `1` to make the server verify session cookies instead of trusting loopback as the "local" user; the auth e2e spec needs it. `scripts/test-all.sh` sets it for the auth phase only, together with `SWARM_COOKIE_SECURE=0` (Playwright's API client won't send a Secure cookie over plain HTTP). |
 | `SCREENSHOT_DIR` | `/workspace/monolith-playtest/<timestamp>` | Screenshot and `summary.json` output directory |
